			<div class="content" id="post-content-2688531">
									

<p>And it is finally up.</p>
<p>I would like to thank Reject, who's <a href="http://scpsandbox2.wikidot.com/reject">draft</a> this article is a substantial rewrite of (under &quot;Vlog&quot;) and gave me permission to do so. I would also like to thank Aiden Eldritch, Dr0Shadow, and WrongJohnSilver for their critique and words of support. And many thanks to C-Dive for <a href="http://ja.scp-wiki.net/scp-2352">translating</a> this onto the Japanese branch :D</p>
<div class="collapsible-block">
<div class="collapsible-block-folded"><a class="collapsible-block-link" href="javascript:;">+Miscellanea&nbsp;(Best&nbsp;not&nbsp;to&nbsp;look&nbsp;at&nbsp;this&nbsp;until&nbsp;after&nbsp;reading&nbsp;the&nbsp;article)</a></div>
<div class="collapsible-block-unfolded" style="display:none">
<div class="collapsible-block-unfolded-link"><a class="collapsible-block-link" href="javascript:;">-Close&nbsp;But&nbsp;I&nbsp;won't&nbsp;stop&nbsp;you</a></div>
<div class="collapsible-block-content">
<p>The channel that led to 2352's discovering was originally supposed to be a reference to Night Mind; sort of a reciprocation for the <a href="https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=tgsDSDDdiNc">SCP Vault</a> video he did. However, after feedback, I conceded that it was blatant and distracting in the original draft, so I made it less explicit.</p>
<p>There are some slight easter eggs in the Webcrawler designation. See if you can guess what they are.</p>
<p>I hope that other people become inspired by what I've included of my DIAMOND idea in this article. If any one does, feel free to PM me and I can offer my thoughts and suggestions.</p>
</div>
